   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Let's start with numbers. A large US Justice Department study followed prisoners released in 2005 from thirty states."
    },
    {
     "text": "Within a year, about forty-four percent had been arrested again. Within three years, sixty-eight percent. Within nine years, eighty-three percent."
    }
   ]
