   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Crime is concentrated. A small group of repeat offenders commits a large share of it. Saad cites survey data in which about one in eight male inmates said they'd been locked up ten or more times before."
    },
    {
     "text": "So when a career offender is released yet again and commits another crime, Saad says, that's not bad luck. It's predictable."
    }
