   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "In 2020, after the murder of George Floyd, calls to defund the police spread across American cities."
    },
    {
     "text": "Several cities cut police budgets, and some restored them as homicides rose. Researchers still debate how much policing changes explain that rise."
    },
    {
     "text": "For Saad, it was empathy for offenders crowding out empathy for victims, who often live in the very same neighbourhoods."
    }
   ]
